      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PAROLLES.\nThat you will take your instant leave o’ the king,\nAnd make this haste as your own good proceeding,\nStrengthen’d with what apology you think\nMay make it probable need.",
